### 1. `dm_ai.c` — EOF `errno` 残留忙等 + 127帧 `(int)plen` 越界

**1a. EOF后`errno==EAGAIN`误判`continue`忙等：**
`dm_ai.c:277-281`（`SO_RCVTIMEO=30s`制造`EAGAIN`超时）+ `682-689`：
```c
    /* P53 调优（AIYOUHUA A1）：30s 收包超时，防止 agent 不回复时永久阻塞 */
    struct timeval tv;
    tv.tv_sec  = 30;
    tv.tv_usec = 0;
    setsockopt(fd, SOL_SOCKET, SO_RCVTIMEO, &tv, sizeof(tv));
...
            while (g_ai_evt_run)
                {
                    int n = ws_recv_text(fd, buf, sizeof(buf));
                    if (n <= 0)
                        {
                            /* SO_RCVTIMEO 30s 超时：连接仍在，继续等；
                             * 断开/close → 退出内循环重连 */
                            if (errno == EAGAIN || errno == EWOULDBLOCK)
                                continue;
                            break;
```
`ws_recv_text`所有失败都`return -1`且不置/清`errno`（`147-150,159-160,166-167,176-177,196-197,208-210`）：
```c
    if (recv(fd, &b0, 1, MSG_WAITALL) != 1)
        return -1;
...
            int n = recv(fd, out + got, plen - got, 0);
            if (n <= 0)
                return -1; // recv==0(EOF有序关闭)不设EAGAIN，残留上次超时EAGAIN
```
→ 对端`close`致`recv==0`时若`errno`残留`EAGAIN`则`continue`空转而非`break+close+重连`。

**1b. 127帧`size_t plen`→`(int)`截断负值：**
`dm_ai.c:152-170,203-212`：
```c
    size_t plen = b1 & 0x7F;
...
    else if (plen == 127)
        {
            unsigned char ext[8];
            if (recv(fd, ext, 8, MSG_WAITALL) != 8)
                return -1;
            plen = 0;
            for (int i = 0; i < 8; i++)
                plen = (plen << 8) | ext[i]; // 64bit可>INT_MAX
...
    if ((int)plen >= outcap) // plen>0x7FFFFFFF时(int)plen变负，截断失效
        plen = outcap - 1;
    size_t got = 0;
    while (got < plen) // 超大plen长循环
        {
            int n = recv(fd, out + got, plen - got, 0); // len被截断/巨大
